Reading the Bus Pirate . . .
COMMAND: BUS_PIRATE { 0x80 0x04 { 0x81 r:2 }
READLINE: BUS_PIRATE WASTE
READLINE: BUS_PIRATE WASTE
READLINE: BUS_PIRATE WASTE
READLINE: BUS_PIRATE WASTE
READLINE: BUS_PIRATE WASTE
READ: BUS_PIRATE WASTE RS_MSB WASTE WASTE 
SET: RESULT = [%RS_MSB%]

